          "title": "You'll want to know: alloggiare",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "alloggiare — \"to lodge, to stay\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Alloggiamo in un piccolo albergo in centro. We are staying in a small hotel in the centre."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "L'alloggio — lodging, accommodation."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
