          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "alloggiare is built on loggia (EtymDB), which was borrowed from Old French loge 'shelter, arbour', from Frankish laubja 'arbour'."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
